{"id":"wb-3-69","name":"广济桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"广济桥 (潮州)","text":"广济桥，俗称湘子桥，是位于广东省潮州市湘桥区东门外韩江上的桥梁。与赵县赵州桥、惠安县洛阳桥及北京市卢沟桥并称“中国四大古桥”，集拱桥、梁桥及浮桥于一体，为中国第一座启闭式浮桥。广济桥为古代闽粤交通要道。全桥长约520米，现存古桥墩21座。1988年1月，中国国务院列入第三批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%BF%E6%B5%8E%E6%A1%A5_(%E6%BD%AE%E5%B7%9E)","revisionId":94091794,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94091794","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fe14089d96d428bf2e6340e4.jpg","title":"20230206_Guangji_Bridge_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20230206_Guangji_Bridge_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/20230206_Guangji_Bridge_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Guangji Bridge, Chaozhou","width":320,"height":213}}